# iCloud Drive sync duplicates (e.g. "importer 2.rs", "references 2/", "index 3.html")
# This repo lives under iCloud Drive, which spawns " N"-suffixed copies on sync conflicts.
# These are always cruft; never commit them. (Already-tracked files are unaffected.)
* [0-9]
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9]
* [0-9][0-9].*
